  "question": {
    "text": "If the direction ratios of a line are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>4</mn></math> and if it makes an angle of&nbsp;<math><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> with the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis, then the sum of the values of <math><mi>λ</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "The direction ratios of the line are&nbsp;<math><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&gt;</mo></math><br />direction ratios of the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis are&nbsp;<math><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&gt;</mo></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Hence, the sum of values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi></math>&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>",
